OL,3,GNEWSA#2k pay rise for MLAs is
OL,4,A'grotesque', says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pay rise of more than #2,000 for
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland Assembly members
OL,8,F(MLAs) is "grotesque", the first
OL,9,Fminister has said.
OL,11,FThe proposals planned for next year
OL,12,Fwould bring MLAs annual salary to
OL,13,F#69,216.
OL,15,FThe increase will take effect from the
OL,16,Ffirst sitting day of the new assembly
OL,17,Fmandate next May, under draft proposals
OL,18,Fby Stormont's Independent Remuneration
OL,19,FBoard.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
