OL,3,GNEWSA#2k pay rise for MLAs is
OL,4,A'grotesque', says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the media at Stormont, she
OL,7,Fsaid: "This issue of wages is not in my
OL,8,Fagenda. It's not something we've pushed
OL,9,Ffor."
